OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday, a fresh westerly wind
OL,6,Fwill bring a mix of sunny spells and
OL,7,Fscattered showers, particularly in the
OL,8,Fnorth. Some of these may be heavy.
OL,9,FDespite the sunny spells, brisk winds
OL,10,Fwill make it feel colder than
OL,11,Fyesterday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe strong winds and showers
OL,14,Fwill ease to bring a settled night.
OL,15,FClear spells and a light breeze will
OL,16,Fallow for a chilly night of single-
OL,17,Fdigit temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
